<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>any piece cut off</i> or <i>severed, portion,</i> ( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύφος, κλάσμα, πτερύγιον,
					ἀκρωτήριον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; part of a house, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.121
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρσεα πόλιος</span>
			<i>the quarters</i> of a city, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.180
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν φάρσεϊ ἑκατέρῳ</span> ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				181
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				186
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. βότρυος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.299
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phan.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. δραχμαῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					664
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίζειν τὸ ἱμάτιον εἰς δώδεκα φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					8.7.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			=
			<i>velamen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥούσιον φ.,</span>
			=
			<i>vexillum,</i> ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ.
			σκεπαστήρια</span> protective <i>sheets</i> or <i>coverings,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.8.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡραῖον τὸ φ. ἄθεσι
			παντοίοις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.6.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνεον φ.</span> ibid.</div>
